SUMMARY:Lindsay Bretz-Morgan's Upfront Theatre Presents: The Rocky Horror Show Night 2
DESCRIPTION:Saturday October 31st\, 2026\nDoors | 8:00 PM\nShow | 9:00 PM \nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $43.35 + Fees\nReserved Orchestra & Riser Seating | $53.50 + Fees \nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Lindsay Bretz-Morgans Upfront Theatre\n—————————————————\nJoin us at Mickey’s Black Box as The Rocky Horror Show RETURNS for a 6th year! \nThis cult phenomenon (the stage show came before the movie) traces the bizarre adventures of super-naive and innocent Brad Majors and Janet Weiss. Follow Brad and Janet as they try desperately to survive the diabolical Riff-Raff & his incestuously sexy sister Magenta\, Columbia\, Eddie\, the – perfect creation – Rocky\, Dr.Scott\, Transylvanian servants and the worlds most powerful but sweet transvestite–a man simply referred to as Frank -n- Furter–who will change their lives and libidos forever. \nThe Rocky Horror Show is presented through special arrangement with Concord Theatricals.\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/lindsay-bretz-morgans-upfront-theatre-presents-the-rocky-horror-show-night-2/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
